		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Colossal, lion-faced giants with plaited manes, girded in thick plate armor. Once, the favored warriors of Pazuzu, the Prince of Demon Winds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 54, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 longsword +7 (2d8) or 1 boulder (far) +7 (2d8) or 1 prismatic aura, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Prismatic Aura</strong>. Rainbow light rays. All mortals within near, CHA 15+ or suffer random effect (d4): 1. Blind 1d4 rounds, 2. Stunned 1d4 rounds, 3. Insane for 1d4 rounds, 8. 3d10 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 2d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
